id: offensive-analysis-mark
name: Offensive Analysis
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: what Analytic Fighter's Offensive Analysis leaves on the one Analyzed - the clock and the bonus the Analyst's,
# read against them (chat.mjs analyticParts, criticalTactics).
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Offensive Analysis: the Analyst's Strike Rolls 1(T) higher against you - won, their Allies' too, till the end of the Analyst's next turn.
text: >
  Offensive Analysis: If you use the Analysis Maneuver, make a Clash (Investigation vs Intuition/Bluff/Stealth) against the targeted Character. Regardless of if you win or lose, increase your Strike Rolls against that target by 1(T) until the end of your next turn. If you won the Clash for this effect, increase the Strike Rolls of all Allies against that Opponent by an equal amount.

---
